---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Privacy Policy"
	description="Privacy Policy for christran.io and associated services"
>
	<p><em>Last updated: May 30, 2026</em></p>

	<p>
		This Privacy Policy describes how <strong>christran.io</strong> collects, uses, and discloses your personal information 
		when you visit our site or use our associated web applications (including sYnX, IllusYn, and other subdomains).
	</p>

	<h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
	<p>
		We aim to collect only the minimal amount of information necessary to provide our services:
	</p>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>Account Information:</strong> If you sign in via our central single sign-on (SSO) service, we store your email address and profile identifiers to manage your sessions.</li>
		<li><strong>Cookies:</strong> We use local browser storage and session cookies to keep you signed in across our services.</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>2. Bot Protection & Spam Prevention (Cloudflare Turnstile)</h2>
	<p>
		To protect our login portals, forms, and resource-heavy endpoints (such as AI image generation) from automated bot abuse, 
		spam, and brute-force attacks, we implement <strong>Cloudflare Turnstile</strong>.
	</p>
	<p>
		Turnstile operates by evaluating telemetry and behavior data from your browser (including screen characteristics, device features, and IP address) 
		to distinguish human visitors from automated bots without tracking your personal browsing habits.
	</p>
	<p>
		The collection and processing of this data is subject to Cloudflare's privacy policies. For more information, please review the 
		<a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/en-gb/turnstile-privacy-policy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Cloudflare Turnstile Privacy Policy</a>.
	</p>

	<h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
	<p>
		Any information collected is used solely to:
	</p>
	<ul>
		<li>Authenticate your user session.</li>
		<li>Prevent abuse, fraud, and server resource depletion.</li>
		<li>Provide the core features of the applications (e.g. saving generated images to your profile gallery).</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>4. Contact Us</h2>
	<p>
		If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy or our data practices, please contact us at:
		<a href="mailto:privacy@christran.io">privacy@christran.io</a>.
	</p>
</Layout>
